      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹7.95 (vs ₹2.31 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.95 (up from ₹2.31 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹8.85b (up 96% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.21b (up 241% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 25% (up from 14% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 59% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 97% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
